  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>Whenever you cast this spell on an active defensive spell that improves a creature’s AC or grants it temporary hit points, each creature affected by the targeted spell gains temporary hit points equal to twice your caster level + your spellcasting ability modifier. When the targeted spell ends or an affected creature is no longer affected by it, the creature loses any remaining temporary hit points from this spell.</p>\n<p>If you are maintaining concentration or dedication on a defensive spell, this spell can uniquely be cast on that active defensive spell without ending that spell or breaking your concentration or dedication.</p>",
